  "description": "The application package\u202fcontoso.myapp, published by Contoso Ltd, is the latest release of MyApp version\u202f1.2.3. This build is distributed under the MIT license and is ready for deployment to Windows environments.\n\nTwo executable installers are available: the 32\u2011bit (x86) installer can be downloaded from\u202fhttps://downloads.contoso.com/myapp/1.2.3/MyApp-Setup-x86.exe and has the SHA\u2011256 hash\u202fd4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f809a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6; the 64\u2011bit (x64) installer is located at\u202fhttps://downloads.contoso.com/myapp/1.2.3/MyApp-Setup-x64.exe with SHA\u2011256 hash\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f809a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3. Both installers are standard Windows\u202f.exe packages.",
